<section aria-labelledby="practice-log">
<h2 id="practice-log">Practice log</h2>
<p>One result is recorded so far. Results are raw correct-answer counts, not converted TOEIC scores.</p>
<div class="reading-table-wrap" role="region" aria-label="Ten-test results" tabindex="0">
<table class="reading-table reading-results">
<caption>Reading tests 1–10</caption>
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Test</th><th scope="col">Date</th><th scope="col">Correct</th><th scope="col">Review</th></tr></thead>
